          <zone h="4000" id="20" type-v2="text" w="72449" x="27551" y="93400">
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold="false" fontcolor="#eaf0fc" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="10">Compare counts and rates together. Prioritize a confirmation-process trial, then measure results against a randomized comparison group.</run>
