            <formatted-text>
              <run bold="true" fontcolor="#ffffff" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="14">Cancellations</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr="border-color" value="#444444" />
              <format attr="border-style" value="none" />
              <format attr="border-width" value="0" />
              <format attr="padding" value="12" />
              <format attr="background-color" value="#111d33" />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h="4200" id="9003" type-v2="text" w="11225" x="1530" y="20000">
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold="false" fontcolor="#99a9c4" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="9">RESERVATIONS REVIEW</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr="border-color" value="#444444" />
              <format attr="border-style" value="none" />
              <format attr="border-width" value="0" />
              <format attr="padding" value="12" />
              <format attr="background-color" value="#111d33" />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h="16500" id="9004" type-v2="text" w="11225" x="1530" y="81000">
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold="false" fontcolor="#a7b6ce" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="10">HISTORICAL ANALYSIS

Compare like periods.
Keep the population visible.

Zak Rademacher</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr="border-color" value="#444444" />
              <format attr="border-style" value="none" />
              <format attr="border-width" value="0" />
              <format attr="padding" value="12" />
              <format attr="background-color" value="#111d33" />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h="4800" id="9010" type-v2="text" w="83929" x="16071" y="90000">
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold="false" fontcolor="#a2b2cc" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="11">02 / METHOD &amp; TRIAL</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr="border-color" value="#444444" />
              <format attr="border-style" value="none" />
              <format attr="border-width" value="0" />
              <format attr="padding" value="12" />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h="8400" id="200" type-v2="text" w="83929" x="16071" y="3600">
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold="true" fontcolor="#eaf0fc" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="31">A bounded decision for reservations</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr="border-color" value="#a2b2cc" />
              <format attr="border-style" value="none" />
              <format attr="border-width" value="0" />
              <format attr="padding" value="12" />
              <format attr="background-color" value="#0b1423" />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h="11400" id="201" type-v2="text" w="83929" x="16071" y="13000">
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold="false" fontcolor="#a2b2cc" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="15">Choose a comparable hotel and arrival period, then examine market-segment counts and rates. Use lead-time bands to define a trial population. Small samples below 100 bookings need caution.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr="border-color" value="#a2b2cc" />
              <format attr="border-style" value="none" />
              <format attr="border-width" value="0" />
              <format attr="padding" value="12" />
              <format attr="background-color" value="#0b1423" />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h="6400" id="202" type-v2="text" w="37627" x="17602" y="29600">
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold="true" fontcolor="#66a0ff" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="20">Population and measures</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr="border-color" value="#a2b2cc" />
              <format attr="border-style" value="none" />
              <format attr="border-width" value="0" />
              <format attr="padding" value="12" />
              <format attr="background-color" value="#142339" />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h="46000" id="203" type-v2="text" w="37627" x="17602" y="36000">
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold="false" fontcolor="#eaf0fc" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="16">One source row represents one booking. Cancellation rate = canceled bookings / bookings in the same selection. Canceled booked nights = recorded length of stay on canceled bookings. Those nights are not proven lost revenue or unfilled capacity. Exact repeats remain because the source has no booking identifier.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr="border-color" value="#a2b2cc" />
              <format attr="border-style" value="none" />
              <format attr="border-width" value="0" />
              <format attr="padding" value="12" />
              <format attr="background-color" value="#142339" />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h="6400" id="204" type-v2="text" w="39158" x="59311" y="29600">
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold="true" fontcolor="#ffad72" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="20">Test the recommendation</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr="border-color" value="#a2b2cc" />
              <format attr="border-style" value="none" />
              <format attr="border-width" value="0" />
              <format attr="padding" value="12" />
              <format attr="background-color" value="#142339" />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h="46000" id="205" type-v2="text" w="39158" x="59311" y="36000">
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold="false" fontcolor="#eaf0fc" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="16">Within a selected hotel, segment and lead-time band, randomize an improved confirmation protocol against business-as-usual. Measure cancellation rate, staff contact workload and guest complaints. The historical snapshot cannot establish a treatment effect. Reservation fields reflect the source extraction snapshot, not guaranteed initial-booking knowledge.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr="border-color" value="#a2b2cc" />
              <format attr="border-style" value="none" />
              <format attr="border-width" value="0" />
              <format attr="padding" value="12" />
              <format attr="background-color" value="#142339" />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr="border-color" value="#444444" />
            <format attr="border-style" value="none" />
            <format attr="border-width" value="0" />
            <format attr="background-color" value="#0b1423" />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid="{2139C220-68F0-49A2-AAAA-2A16F72F9A0A}" />
    </dashboard>
